<LegalLayout title="Delete Your Account" appName="Prep & Provide" lastUpdated="October 19, 2026">

  <p>
    You can delete your <strong>Prep &amp; Provide</strong> account directly within the app at any time.
    This page is provided by <strong>Refuge &amp; Sword Publishing LLC</strong> in accordance with
    Google Play data deletion requirements.
  </p>

  <h2>How to Delete Your Account</h2>
  <ol style="margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem; color: var(--midnight-navy);">
    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Log in to your Prep &amp; Provide account.</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Tap <strong>Settings</strong> in the bottom navigation.</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Scroll to the bottom and tap <strong style="color: #c0392b;">Delete Account</strong>.</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Confirm your choice when prompted.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Deletion happens immediately upon confirmation and cannot be undone.</p>

  <h2>What Happens to a Shared Household</h2>
  <p>
    Recipes, meal plans, and grocery lists belong to the household rather than to the person who
    created them. What happens when you delete your account depends on whether anyone else is in
    your household:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>If other members remain:</strong> the household and everything in it stays with them,
      and one of the remaining members becomes the household owner. You are simply removed. This
      means your recipes and plans are not deleted, because they were never only yours.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>If you are the last member:</strong> the household is deleted along with all of its
      recipes, ingredients, meal plans, history, grocery lists, and uploaded recipe photos.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If you want your household's content removed entirely, remove the other members first, or ask
    them to leave, before deleting your account.
  </p>

  <h2>What Gets Deleted</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your email address and account credentials.</li>
    <li>Your profile, including display name and subscription status.</li>
    <li>Your household membership.</li>
    <li>Your subscriber record with our payment provider.</li>
    <li>The household's content and uploaded photos, if you are its last member.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What Is Retained</h2>
  <p>
    We do not retain personal data after account deletion except where required by law.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you subscribed through Google Play, Google maintains its own transaction records
    independently of us and subject to its own privacy policy. <strong>Deleting your account does
    not cancel a Google Play subscription.</strong> Cancel it separately in your Google Play
    account settings to avoid further charges.
  </p>

  <h2>Need Help?</h2>
  <p>
    If you have trouble deleting your account or have questions, contact us at
    <a href="mailto:support@refugeandsword.com" style="color: var(--heritage-gold);">
      support@refugeandsword.com
    </a>.
  </p>

</LegalLayout>
